    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-fructŭōsus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unfruitful</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. Arb. 8, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cultura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 2, 32</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>fruitless</i>, <i>useless</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">preces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 8, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epistula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Contr. 3, 19 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">militia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					1, 51</span></i>
			.— <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infructŭōsē</span></b> , <i>fruitlessly</i>, <i>uselessly</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 12</span></i>, n. 16; <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep.
			67</span></i>, n. 6.—<i>Comp.</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 1, 9</span></i>.</div>
